WEBVTT

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.000
Everyone.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.940
Look upon the sunshine of Regalo.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:16.200
I, the 21st card, Il Mondo: 
The World, hereby swear

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.700
to give the victor the title of "Papa"

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.200
and grant their wish.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.270
And...

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.730
You will marry Felicitá.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.420
I hereby announce

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.380
the commencement of the Arcana Duello.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.840
Papa!

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.340
All glory to Arcana!

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.240
The Arcana Duello.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.690
This is a competition to 
determine the one with

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:56.940
the strongest Arcana powers.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.600
This will be a knockout tournament.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.540
The final two will compete 
in the final round

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.070
and the victor will earn 
the right to battle Papa.

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:08.840
And if they are able to defeat Papa,

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.270
they will win the Arcana Duello.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.760
Again she demonstrates her skills 
with a series of kicks to the chest.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.470
The winner is the red witch 
of Regalo, Felicitá!

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.710
His sword is going strong 
yet again today.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.520
The esperanza of youth!

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:28.980
The winner is...

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.020
The young sailor king of Regalo,

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.440
Libertá!

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.780
Gaze in awe at the skilled back blade of

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.280
this young man with a fever for slaughter.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:43.650
The winner is...

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:48.000
Regalo's hard-as-corundum 
swordsman, Nova!

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.960
Continuing after the victories 
of the young three...

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.560
Tra coppo scomparire!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.500
The fast talker with the slicked back

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.270
hair has used his Arcana powers!

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.170
He has made himself invisible.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.610
The winner is...

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.020
Regalo's Don Juan Tenorio,

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.020
Debito!

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Porci tutto trapassare!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.320
He's keeping a whole gang 
on the move by himself!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.360
The winner is...

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.360
Regalo's wild man who drinks 
like a fish and eats like a horse,

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.980
Pace!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.790
Il pacio dell'angelo!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.850
He's rendering his opponent's 
Arcana powers useless

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.040
with his own lawless powers.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.090
The winner is...

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.760
The high class servant 
who loves Regalo,

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.760
Luca!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.490
However, these have only been 
the preliminary matches.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:41.680
The Greater Arcana cards will 
now battle each other.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.150
The first to appear is...

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.080
Felicitá!

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.270
Her opponent will be...

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.350
Debito!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.350
I'm not going to hold back, Bambina.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.670
I'm going to win this Duello,

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:56.320
and steal you away.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.560
We'll see if you can!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.130
You really are amazing!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.270
Grazie, Bambina!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.210
I'd like you to win 
the Duello, Princess.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.720
But if I don't give it my all here,

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.130
you won't smile for me.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.340
Yep.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.590
Let's go, Princess!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.430
The day I heard about 
the Arcana Duello,

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.960
I thought to myself...

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:33.100
that out of everyone, 
I would not fight you, Milady.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.610
I do not want to fight you.

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:38.680
If I were to have to fight you, 
I intended to withdraw.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:44.240
But now, seeing you here 
standing your ground, I thought,

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.460
what good would it be 
for me to run away?

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:53.460
Therefore, Milady, I cannot lose this battle.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:55.960
The same goes for me!

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.920
Well then, here I come!

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.260
I have absolutely no idea how I lost.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.220
No kidding.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.890
I don't remember holding back at all.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:13.270
Nothing less from Milady.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.890
Congratulations!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:25.490
Are you three losers 
having a pity party?

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.680
Shut up, old man.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.950
I hear you withdrew 
from the tournament.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.330
That usually wouldn't be allowed.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.420
I'm sure you used your position 
as advisor to do so.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:41.950
As advisor, I could tell you 
why the three of you lost.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.540
There's no need for that.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.550
It's just the fact that 
Milady has grown

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.100
much stronger than we had imagined.

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.430
The fact that that was the only reason

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.800
you could come up with

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.810
would be why you lost.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.670
The correct answer is

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:03.530
Milady has to use the Wheel of Fortune.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:07.370
Why would she use the 
Tarocco that would

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.120
cause her to lose her memory again?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.500
He's right. And Papa's safe now, 
so there's no more need to...

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.700
It can't be...

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.880
The relationship between 
Papa and The World...

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:22.220
A surprisingly brilliant 
insight coming from you.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:25.580
With Milady's present strength,

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.730
she was not able to 
change the relationship

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:30.120
between Mondo and the World.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.930
Then Papa...

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:37.970
However, Milady has learned 
from The Lovers

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:42.800
that they would nullify 
The Wheel of Fortune's consequences.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.480
What does that mean?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:52.370
It means that no one other 
than Milady can save Mondo.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.580
I see. Now I understand.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:06:01.210
Yeah, I can see why we 
lost against Bambina.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.230
It's because her fate

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.930
is far more cruel than 
I could have imagined.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.760
Milady...

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:14.890
I failed as your attendant.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.040
Go Libertá!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.910
Libertá's opponent is...

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:26.340
The giant of the sea 
that protects Regalo,

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.030
Dante!

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.490
Who would have thought 
I'd be fighting you.

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:32.990
Dante,

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:38.000
I'll prove to you that 
I've become stronger.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:39.710
And...

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:42.420
I'll surpass you!

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.140
Will you?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.460
I look forward to it.

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:48.550
Yeah!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.470
Go, Nova!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.220
Nova's opponent is...

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.890
Regalo's exotic priestess,

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.310
Sumire!

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.060
Nova,

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.190
let us have a good battle.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.150
Yes, Mama.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:13.120
I'd like you to see 
how much I've grown.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.000
<i>My host,</i>

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.120
<i>you don't have time, do you?</i>

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.280
<i>Gli Amanti...</i>

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:29.060
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:34.470
<i>Who should I choose in 
order to save Papa?</i>

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.210
Take this!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.190
<i>Thank you, Dante.</i>

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.090
<i>Because you fought me</i>

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.260
<i>that night, disguised in that mask,</i>

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.720
<i>I was able to learn that I 
could use Arcana powers.</i>

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:25.440
<i>So...</i>

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.770
<i>I was able to save Princess that time.</i>

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.240
What will you do?

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:42.750
This ends it!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.780
<i>That's right...</i>

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:49.520
<i>Arcana powers are for 
protecting those you love.</i>

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.340
<i>The one precious</i>

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.840
<i>to me is...</i>

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:58.590
Return!

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.190
Well done, Libertá.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:14.300
Dante...

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:19.730
The winner is Libertá!

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:23.330
Libertá...

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:31.060
Nova,

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.570
you're still hesitating.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.030
It's true.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.130
I'm hesitating

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:39.890
to swing a sword at you.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.240
I'm sorry,

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:45.600
but this won't be so easy to win 
with naïve feelings like that.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.720
<i>Thank you very much, Mama.</i>

00:09:56.310 --> 00:10:00.960
<i>I would like to thank you 
for having the heart</i>

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.120
<i>to treat me as an equal.</i>

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.790
<i>That day, when you showed me 
the warmth of a true family,</i>

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:12.400
<i>I was envious of you and your family.</i>

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.590
<i>I was trying to ignore the fact</i>

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.010
<i>that I had put my parents to sleep,</i>

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.010
<i>when they tried to use me 
as a tool in their plot</i>

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.680
<i>because of their jealousy toward you.</i>

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.970
<i>But that's no longer the case.</i>

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.400
<i>Now I will walk</i>

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:29.660
<i>with my parents when they awaken.</i>

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.270
Prepare yourself!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.240
<i>The one who gave me that chance</i>

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.320
<i>is her!</i>

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:57.410
Forgive me.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:05.720
The winner is...

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.680
Nova!

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:11.350
Nova...

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.620
That was a splendid back blade strike.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.280
You have shown me

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:25.700
how much you've grown.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:27.500
Mama...

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.380
Mama.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:35.960
Yes?

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.260
That's...

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:43.310
When we took Felicitá 
after she'd lost her memory,

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.640
we found this by chance.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.250
I see.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:50.350
But perhaps it wasn't chance.

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:56.240
Maybe it was destined to 
be back in your hands.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.330
Back in my hands?

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:07.410
I will win, no matter what, 
so I can give this to her.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.120
Just you watch,

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:10.580
Mama.

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.780
The fact that you two 
will be crossing swords

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.760
is probably destiny, as well.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:30.560
The ones who have been 
blessed by the sea are...

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.190
La Morte

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:35.690
and

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.200
Il Matto!

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:41.300
The Arcana Duello is 
reaching its finale!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:44.720
This will truly be one for 
the records in Regalo!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:47.990
The winner of this match 
will fight against Milady,

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.470
who has already advanced to the finals,

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.850
for the chance to challenge Papa!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:58.590
May the seas bless this 
holy Arcana Duello.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:02.230
Do you remember

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.720
when I said that I would fight for Fel?

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.350
I said I would do the same, didn't I?

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.000
Yeah.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:11.890
I promised her

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.930
that I would free her.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.780
Then promise me, as well.

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.110
That you will give your all 
in this fight against me.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.680
I promise.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:28.700
I will give my all and defeat you!

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:31.290
This, too, I swear.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.970
I will not hold back

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.120
and I will defeat you with everything I have.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.060
Here I come, Nova!

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:41.300
Bring it, Libertá!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.140
If you chose one to get close to,

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.670
it'd be easy to determine 
feelings and relationships.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.900
<i>If I do that, I'll be 
able to save Papa.</i>

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:07.590
<i>Even if I can't right now, 
someday I'll be able to.</i>

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.110
<i>Just like Princess said,</i>

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:12.530
<i>I'm able to use my Arcana powers now.</i>

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.000
<i>I'll defeat Nova with these powers,</i>

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.320
<i>so I can battle with Princess.</i>

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.070
<i>I want Princess to know 
my current self.</i>

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:20.830
<i>And...</i>

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:26.130
<i>As long as I'm with Princess,</i>

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.470
<i>I feel I can become even stronger!</i>

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.270
<i>Felicitá was the one who 
gave me the strong heart</i>

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.390
<i>to face my past.</i>

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:42.890
<i>I have to fight her so I can 
show her my gratitude.</i>

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:46.360
<i>So I will defeat you, Libertá,</i>

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.980
<i>and win against Felicitá, as well.</i>

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.200
<i>Then...</i>

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.920
<i>I will proudly give her that ring.</i>

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.020
Things are becoming quite intense.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:25.070
The sun is going down...

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.280
But neither one is 
willing to back down!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:32.080
I'm going to use all of my 
remaining Arcana powers

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.410
on this final blow!

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.370
I was thinking the exact same thing.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:39.760
I'm going to hit you with 
everything I've got!

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:44.380
<i>Have you decided on which one?</i>

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.800
If you don't, 
love cannot be established.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.890
If love is not established,

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.380
you will not be able 
to acquire the power

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.010
that The Wheel of Fortune requires,

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:58.280
nor will you be able to 
nullify the consequences.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:05.010
The one who's going to fight

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.320
Felicitá is me!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.440
Destino Lustreggiare!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.070
Fuuka Renyuu!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.460
Are you finally awake?

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:33.840
We...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.730
Who won the match?!

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.850
It ended in a draw.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.870
A draw?

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.580
After the match, you both 
lost consciousness.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:50.610
And...

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:55.780
Milady got the chance to 
fight Mondo by default.

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.250
Felicitá did?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.460
Who won?

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.750
She was able to beat Mondo.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:05.730
Because of that, 
Mondo's life was lengthened.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.310
It appears that the two have awakened.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.180
Papa's...

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.000
Life?

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:13.510
The Wheel of Fortune was able 
to change the relationship

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.490
between Mondo and The World.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.640
More! More!

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:36.290
Is that the best your special kick can do?

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.570
You think?

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:44.660
Not bad.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.250
<i>I have no objections,</i>

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:56.740
<i>but I have to show you my strength.</i>

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.330
<i>As someone</i>

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:01.310
<i>who is going to succeed me</i>

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:04.860
<i>and lead the family as the Donna,</i>

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:06.650
<i>this is something that you will need.</i>

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.480
This time we'll start with this.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.060
<i>If you cannot become stronger,</i>

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.410
<i>you cannot be kind.</i>

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.030
<i>If you aren't kind, you won't be able to</i>

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.540
<i>give each member of the family</i>

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.830
<i>an equal amount of love.</i>

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.570
<i>Felicitá,</i>

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.820
<i>you have always had more 
than sufficient kindness.</i>

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:37.130
<i>But you must become stronger 
than you are now.</i>

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.260
<i>Then you'll be able to 
become someone kind enough</i>

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.640
<i>to love anyone.</i>

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:48.040
<i>Someone kind enough to love anyone...</i>

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.770
Have you decided on which one?

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:56.530
If you don't, 
love cannot be established.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.810
<i>I was putting the feelings that</i>

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:04.080
<i>Libertá and Nova have for me</i>

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.700
<i>on a scale.</i>

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.500
Hold on.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.330
What's this?!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.660
Recently, Papa had been 
rumored as being ill...

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.710
Could it be striking at this point?!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.060
We're not done yet!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.220
Felicitá?

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.110
I'm sorry, Papa.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.430
What are you talking about?

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.910
<i>You don't want me to become</i>

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.940
<i>someone who picks someone they love</i>

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.320
<i>because of calculations.</i>

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.240
<i>Yet I...</i>

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:54.120
<i>That which The Wheel of Fortune desires</i>

00:19:56.930 --> 00:20:00.270
is the strong, kind heart that is able to

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.350
truthfully reply to the strong feelings

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:04.270
of a loved one.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:08.280
To reply to the feelings 
of a loved one...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:14.350
By choosing those people as our hosts,

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:16.820
we are able to truly release our power.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:23.370
Then for me to host Arcana powers...

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:26.850
No, my host. 
You have realized the truth.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:27.580
What?

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:33.360
The one thing you need 
to wish for the most.

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:43.760
Thank you, Libertá.

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:46.600
Thank you, Nova.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:53.600
Tonight...

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:58.270
We are celebrating 
Milady's 17th birthday,

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.690
as well as Papa's recovery.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.120
Papa!

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:06.090
Everyone, thank you 
for gathering today.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:09.740
The winner from the other 
day's Arcana Duello

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:12.520
is my daughter, Felicitá.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.480
The promise of marrying 
my daughter to the

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.170
victor has been voided.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.760
To give them my title...

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.640
This has not been voided.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:27.410
Next, I would like to grant 
the victor her wish.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.100
My wish is...

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:36.270
for Papa to remain Papa 
for as long as he lives.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:41.070
Therefore, I cannot accept 
his title just yet.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:44.970
I...

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.280
shall grant this wish.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:47.920
Papa!

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.740
All glory to Arcana!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:52.990
My daughter grew in the Duello.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.780
Because she has grown,

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:57.460
there is no need to have 
her marry so easily.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:02.500
Those who want to marry my 
daughter, step forward.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:06.380
I shall see if you're worthy!

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:08.930
What? Exactly where is this going?

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.060
I've got a bad feeling...

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.970
Indeed...

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:17.060
I don't want to give my 
daughter away just yet!

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:22.190
No, I won't give her away 
as long as I live!

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.950
Apparently Papa's grown the least...

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:27.360
No kidding.

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:31.200
Well, you could say this is how 
things have always been.

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:35.140
No use in arguing!

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:35.160
Mondou Muyou (No use in arguing!)

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:46.020
Apparently this is how things 
are going to be for a while.

00:22:46.020 --> 00:22:46.790
Yeah.

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:50.430
But I don't intend to always 
leave things like this.

00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:53.640
That's my line, chickpea.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.940
Don't call me a chickpea...

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:01.060
Mondo, we haven't done our toast yet.

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:02.650
Salute!

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:04.510
Salute!

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:05.580
There's trouble!

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:06.770
Something is going on at the harbor!

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:09.320
Go!

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:13.700
Go and do what you need 
to do, Felicitá!

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:17.520
In the name of the Arcana Famiglia!

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:20.260
Leave it to me, Papa!

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:25.130
Huh?

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:27.300
W-Wait!
